<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BJ Services raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BJ Services raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it upgraded BJ Services Co to strong buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Cited recent six percent price increase in U.S. and said that &quot;for each one percent real price increase in the U.S., BJ Services' earnings per share increase by $0.13.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-3/8 to 48.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
